  "name": "Tipo de Moneda",
  "source": "ISO 4217 alpha-3, which is what catálogo 02 defers to — SUNAT's anexo gives no list of its own, only the ISO reference. Scoped to the currencies this platform can actually handle: `select` on the three the issuance UI offers (PEN, USD, EUR), and the rest display-only. flags.priceable marks the currencies perunio-backend/src/services/tipo-cambio-bcrp.service.ts can fetch a rate for (MONEDA_CONFIG), which is the real constraint on emitting in a currency: a detracción must be converted to PEN. Currency SYMBOLS are deliberately absent — they are typographic convention, not catalog data, and the repo's README rules them out.",
